    <h1>Creative Direction &amp; Omnichannel Brand Systems</h1>
    <p class="project-subtitle" style="text-align: center; color: var(--color-muted); margin-bottom: 2rem;">Connecting Physical Retail Marketing with In-App Product Experiences</p>

    <!-- Executive Scorecard -->
    <div class="project-meta-list">
      <p><span class="meta-label">Leadership Role:</span> Creative Lead &amp; Brand-Product Strategist</p>
      <p><span class="meta-label">Scope &amp; Reach:</span> CVS ExtraCare &amp; ExtraCare Plus Brand Ecosystem across 9,000+ Stores, Web &amp; Mobile App</p>
      <p><span class="meta-label">Cross-Functional Partners:</span> Store Experience &amp; Environmental Design, CRM &amp; Lifecycle Marketing, Analytics &amp; Behavioral Change (A&amp;BC), Digital Product Squads</p>
