    <p class="project-intro">At enterprise scale, brand marketing and digital product design cannot live in separate worlds. As creative lead and strategist for CVS Health’s flagship loyalty programs (ExtraCare and ExtraCare Plus), my mission was to bridge that gap. I established a cohesive creative direction that connected physical in-store signage, CRM marketing campaigns, and interactive digital interfaces into an unbroken customer journey.</p>

