    <h3>Designing the Visual Language for Punch Cards &amp; Badges</h3>
    <p>The gamification experience was organized into two distinct behavioral products:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Punch Cards (Routine Creators):</strong> Modular, customizable progress components that could be easily adapted across various retail categories (beauty, pharmacy, vitamins) as the program expanded.</li>
      <li><strong>Badges (Affinity Builders):</strong> Collaborated with the Analytics &amp; Behavioral Change (A&amp;BC) team to identify which customer accomplishments were most motivating. I then directed the creation of a unified suite of badge graphics, naming conventions, and micro-copy that maintained the CVS healthcare brand while adding an element of fun.</li>
    </ul>

